REPLACE_ME: This is a placeholder for `favicon-96x96.png`.
Please generate a real 96x96 PNG from `assets/img/favicons/favicon.svg`:

Using ImageMagick locally:

convert assets/img/favicons/favicon.svg -background none -resize 96x96 assets/img/favicons/favicon-96x96.png

Then commit the generated file to replace this placeholder.
